"""Reuse clean native SQLite handles with request-bound logical leases.

Each caller receives a distinct closeable lease. Closing invalidates its
cursors and rolls back unfinished work. Writes, changed connection state,
temporary objects and ambiguous operations retire the physical handle.
Every SQL read still executes; no row, entitlement or authority is cached.
An explicit native DB target permits one clean idle handle per server thread.
Every borrow fences owner, exact factory, database identity and connection state.
"""
